look panel A noon terminals about 18 to 21 V across 7 ohm (P = V^2 / 7, pwg8 60 W), sky 15; multiblock across 2 ohm: P = V^2 / 2 about 3.5 to 4 x panel A's 7 ohm power (record; pwg8 at 7 ohm only 1.42x); panel B lower power than A's first reads (record both), panel A still override=none after reload (upstream-same); night: B terminals 0; bearing: the assemble line's lastException text (none + running=false = contraption.assemble returned false), output non-zero at noon, second read after it turns (record)
